  "body": "Closes #770\nClaim: cloud/i770-sonnet\n\n**Problem.** The topic list's top bar had `square.and.pencil` \"Nouveau sujet\" as `primaryAction` and no refresh button (only pull-to-refresh). Legacy @ 87fe0d1c has \"+\" then refresh in the trailing group.\n\n**Cause.** The bar was not ported to the legacy layout (`MainWindow.swift:835-846`); `ToolbarRefreshIcon` (`Common.swift:393-404`) was never ported.\n\n**Change.**\n- `TopicListView`: one `ToolbarItemGroup(.topBarTrailing)`: \"+\" (`plus`, label \"Nouveau sujet\", same action and visibility as before), then \"Actualiser\" with `ToolbarRefreshIcon`. `.refreshable` kept.\n- `ToolbarRefreshIcon`: `arrow.clockwise` with `symbolEffect(.rotate, repeating)` while loading; the label is never swapped for a `ProgressView`.\n- `TopicListModel.canRefresh` (`!loader.isLoading`): legacy `.disabled(viewModel.isLoading)` (`MainWindow.swift:381-393`).\n- The Favoris tab (same view, `RootTabsView.swift:72`) gets the refresh button too, next to its source menu; legacy's Favoris screen has one (`Favorites.swift:798-806`).\n- Differences, listed in the file's pointer: \"+\" is hidden, not greyed, when the account cannot post (legacy `.disabled`, `:842`); no haptic on refresh (`:382`, no haptics caller yet).\n- Not done: refresh in the bottom bar on a cover-screen layout (`:849-851`): SwiftHFR has no such layout. Avatar next to back and the filter belong to #427.\n- Legacy VoiceOver label for refresh: \"Actualiser\" (`MainWindow.swift:385`).\n\n**Tests.** `theRefreshButtonIsDisabledOnlyWhileALoadRuns` (`TopicListModelTests`): with `canRefresh` stubbed to `{ true }` the handler records `[true, true]` and the `[false, false]` expectation fails (checked by the reviewer); on the base it does not compile. Cloud cannot build: CI is the first compile; Mac checks (dark mode, Dynamic Type XL, side by side with legacy) remain.\n\nReview: Opus APPROVE on 35cd228 (comment below); one follow-up commit for the pointer comment only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGVUeZaaqQWWQU1RTj",
