   "body": "Merged `dev-swift` (#787 touched `TopicListView.swift`) into the branch: head 15045dbc. The merge applied cleanly; `git show --remerge-diff 15045dbc` is empty, so the Opus APPROVE of 35cd228 (and the comment-only commit 95c4ca10) survives (AGENTS.md §8).\n\nThe red \"App build + tests\" on 95c4ca10 is not a build failure: the job only ran the draft gate (`macOS jobs run when the PR is marked ready for review (#477)`, exit 1). No #704 involved. The PR stays a draft; the first real macOS run comes when it is marked ready.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
